data: {"id": "924f93b3f67f4233-thinking-parallel_evidence-730", "run_id": "924f93b3f67f4233", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已收到可观测性 baseline，执行后续 k8s 工具以补充关键证据。\n\n1. **Metrics (已完成)**: 确认 `reason=\"OOMKilled\"`, `waiting_reason=\"CrashLoopBackOff\"`, `restarts=23`。强证据指向 OOM。\n2. **Logging (已完成)**: ES 日志仅见 `\"startup allocation 256Mi\"`，未捕获到崩溃瞬间。需通过 `kubectl previous logs` 抓取容器退出前的最后一批日志。\n3. **Tracing (已完成)**: 流量为空，符合 OOM 进程被内核强行终止且来不及发请求的特征。\n4. **Topology & Events (待执行)**: 获取具体 Pod 描述和 Events。\n\n**补充调查计划**：\n- 执行 kubectl describe, kubectl get yaml, kubectl previous logs, kubectl events。\n- 验证 OOMKilled 对应的资源限额配置。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789383732920, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

