data: {"id": "924f93b3f67f4233-thinking-parallel_evidence-1313", "run_id": "924f93b3f67f4233", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结论：aiops-case-v15/workload\n\n**1. 实体身份与生命周期确认**\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v15/workload`, UID `da351bf0-c4ab-47a0-b24d-7c7a75950753`。\n- **状态**: `CrashLoopBackOff` (Waiting), 重启次数 **23** 次。\n- **节点**: `node2`。\n\n**2. 根因证据：OOMKilled**\n- **Terminated Reason**: `OOMKilled` (由 kubectl describe 和 Prometheus `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason` 交叉确认)。\n- **Exit Code**: `137` (SIGKILL, 由 OOM Killer 触发)。\n- **资源冲突事实**:\n  - 容器启动命令：`memory=bytearray(256*1024*1024)` (**尝试申请 256 MiB**)。\n  - 容器内存", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789383742193, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

